---
// FAQ.astro
---
<section id="faq" class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-slate-50">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">
        Frequently Asked <span class="text-blue-900">Questions</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Before you book a service, here are the answers to the questions we hear most often from our customers in Bangalore. Still confused? Our team is just a phone call away.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQ Accordion -->
    <div class="space-y-3">
      
      <!-- FAQ 1 -->
      <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
        <summary class="flex justify-between items-center p-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
          <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm md:text-base pr-4">What are the signs that my RO needs servicing?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-900 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-slate-600 border-t border-slate-100 pt-4">
          If you notice slow water flow, unusual taste or smell, leakage, or the TDS alarm beeping continuously, your RO needs immediate attention. Also, if it's been more than 6 months since the last service, it's time to book a maintenance check.
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 2 -->
      <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
        <summary class="flex justify-between items-center p-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
          <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm md:text-base pr-4">Do you charge a visiting fee if no repair is needed?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-900 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-slate-600 border-t border-slate-100 pt-4">
          No, we do not charge any visiting fee. Our technician will inspect your RO thoroughly and give you an honest diagnosis. If no repair is required, you only pay for the general service charges, if applicable.
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 3 -->
      <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
        <summary class="flex justify-between items-center p-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
          <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm md:text-base pr-4">Can you repair RO purifiers that are out of warranty?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-900 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-slate-600 border-t border-slate-100 pt-4">
          Yes, absolutely. We service RO purifiers regardless of whether they are under warranty or not. For out-of-warranty units, we use genuine spare parts and provide our own 90-day service warranty on the repair work.
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 4 -->
      <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
        <summary class="flex justify-between items-center p-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
          <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm md:text-base pr-4">What payment methods do you accept?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-900 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-slate-600 border-t border-slate-100 pt-4">
          We accept all major payment methods including cash, UPI (Google Pay, PhonePe, Paytm), and bank transfers. Payment is collected only after the service is completed to your satisfaction.
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 5 -->
      <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
        <summary class="flex justify-between items-center p-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
          <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm md:text-base pr-4">Do you offer emergency RO repair on Sundays and holidays?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-900 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-slate-600 border-t border-slate-100 pt-4">
          Yes, we understand that water purifier issues can't wait. We provide emergency repair services on weekends and public holidays. Just give us a call and we'll try our best to send a technician on the same day.
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 6 -->
      <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
        <summary class="flex justify-between items-center p-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
          <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm md:text-base pr-4">How do I know when to replace the RO membrane?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-900 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-slate-600 border-t border-slate-100 pt-4">
          RO membranes typically last 18-24 months depending on your water quality and usage. If you notice a drop in purified water output, increased TDS levels, or the water tastes different, it's a sign that the membrane needs replacement. Our technician will check it during service.
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 7 -->
      <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
        <summary class="flex justify-between items-center p-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
          <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm md:text-base pr-4">Can I get a service for multiple RO purifiers at home or office?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-900 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-slate-600 border-t border-slate-100 pt-4">
          Yes, we handle both residential and commercial RO servicing. If you have multiple purifiers at home or need servicing for your office, we offer special discounts and can send a team to handle everything in one visit.
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 8 -->
      <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
        <summary class="flex justify-between items-center p-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
          <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm md:text-base pr-4">Is it safe to use my RO after a repair?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-900 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-slate-600 border-t border-slate-100 pt-4">
          Absolutely. After every repair, our technician flushes the system and runs a quality test to ensure the water is safe for drinking. We also sanitize the internal components before handing it back to you. Your family's safety is our top priority.
        </div>
      </details>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom CTA -->
    <div class="text-center mt-10">
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mb-4">Still have questions? Our support team is here to help!</p>
      <a href="tel:+919008315606" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-yellow-500 hover:bg-yellow-600 text-slate-900 font-bold py-3.5 px-8 rounded-xl shadow-md transition duration-300 text-sm">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z"></path></svg>
        Call Us Now
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>